{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>伍允龍女友李蔓瑩（Renee)在社交網分享健身日常，她發文：「Back to gym world!!! 好好咁帶多啲多巴胺同安多酚畀自己，好好咁將啲瘦咗鬆咗嘅肉變做肌肉，好好咁繼續fill up每日嘅schedule(間唔中全日留喺屋企陪Nigo/打機都係日程之一)。」做運動可能較孤獨黑板，不過出名身材好的Renee就花心思在運動服上，以性感裝束示人，令做運動變得更有樂趣，網民大讚身材愈來愈fit。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.857290+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T09:01:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T11:36:38.486878+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:50.313131+00:00","content_hash":"6947335847a63368df0dd8c2814376a1f1e7ac22966bcad92c335c2dbe039aa0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.857290+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}